# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Beyond the Game — environment variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the keys you have. Every key below is
# read SERVER-SIDE only (in /api/*.js) and is never exposed to the browser.
#
# With a key missing, the matching feature shows an honest "needs a key to go
# live" state in the UI. It never shows fake or placeholder data.
#
# Local dev: `npm run dev` loads this file automatically (see vite.config.js).
# Production: set these in your Node host (Vercel / Netlify / Render). NOTE the
# static GitHub Pages deploy has no server, so live-data routes are inactive
# there — host the /api functions on a Node platform to switch them on.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Live jobs near you — Reed is primary. Free key: https://www.reed.co.uk/developers
REED_API_KEY=

# Live jobs fallback — Adzuna. Free keys: https://developer.adzuna.com
ADZUNA_APP_ID=
ADZUNA_APP_KEY=

# Local colleges + opening hours — Google Places.
# https://console.cloud.google.com (enable "Places API")
# NOTE: open-day DATES are not available from Places. Each college exposes an
# editable open-day field; dates need a per-college source.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Job fairs & events — Eventbrite. https://www.eventbrite.com/platform/api
# NOTE: public event search is restricted. Even with a token, search may return
# no results unless your app has partner search access. The UI flags this.
EVENTBRITE_TOKEN=

# Tailored career suggestions — Anthropic (optional enrichment over the built-in
# career database). https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
